# 2026-10-28 eve: fsext + DisCo 0.1 (condor 16526052) -> score, Z+X (per-jet), 1D optbin10, 2D cat40
JOB S_2022preEE_bkg score.sub
VARS S_2022preEE_bkg model="fsextdisco0p1" era="2022preEE" kind="bkg"
RETRY S_2022preEE_bkg 1
JOB S_2022preEE_sig score.sub
VARS S_2022preEE_sig model="fsextdisco0p1" era="2022preEE" kind="sig"
RETRY S_2022preEE_sig 1
JOB S_2022postEE_bkg score.sub
